OL,3,GNEWSASnooker champion Dott told boy to
OL,4,Astay out while in room with girl, jury
OL,5,Atold
OL,6,
OL,7,FSnooker player Graeme Dott allegedly
OL,8,Ftold a boy to stay out while he was in
OL,9,Fa room with a girl he is accused of
OL,10,Fabusing.
OL,12,FThe High Court in Glasgow heard that
OL,13,Fthe former world champion is alleged to
OL,14,Fhave become "quite angry" when the
OL,15,Fchild walked in.
OL,17,FDott, 49, is accused of lewd and
OL,18,Flibidinous behaviour towards two
OL,19,Fyoungsters, a girl and a boy, between
OL,20,F1993 and 2010.
OL,22,FDott denies the charges against him.
